sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Login Page
    participant FB_Client as Firebase Client SDK
    participant API as Next.js Protected Route
    participant Middleware as Next.js Middleware
    participant FB_Admin as Firebase Admin SDK
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>UI: Submits phone number (OTP) / Magic Link
    UI->>FB_Client: Authenticate
    FB_Client-->>UI: Returns Firebase ID Token
    UI->>API: Request with Session Cookie / Token
    
    note over Middleware,FB_Admin: Request Interception
    API->>Middleware: Intercept Request
    Middleware->>FB_Admin: Verify ID Token Signature
    FB_Admin-->>Middleware: Token Valid (uid)
    Middleware->>DB: Check/Create User Record
    Middleware-->>API: Allow Request (Add User Context)
    API-->>User: Authorized Response
